  <TM_Cantrips.label>咒语</TM_Cantrips.label>
  <!--原中文: '流浪者没有特定职业的能力，相反，他们擅长一般的咒语或口头禅。咒语被大多数法师抛弃，仅仅是为了方便，不需要额外的技能训练，但流浪者采取了另一种方法。通过投入时间和精力去理解咒语，流浪者能够在效果，法力消耗和效率方面提高几乎所有的通用能力。\n有关详细信息，请参见技能。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Wandering mages do not have class specific abilities, instead, they excel at general spells or cantrips. 
	
Cantrips are discarded by most mages as mere conveniences which require no additional skill training, but the wanderer takes another approach. By investing time and effort into understanding cantrips, the wanderer is able to improve almost all general abilities in utility, power, and efficiency. 

See skills for more details.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Wandering mages do not have class specific abilities, instead, they excel at general spells or cantrips. 
	
Cantrips are discarded by most mages as mere conveniences which require no additional skill training, but the wanderer takes another approach. By investing time and effort into understanding cantrips, the wanderer is able to improve almost all general abilities in utility, power, and efficiency. 

See skills for more details.-->
  <TM_Cantrips.description>流浪者没有特定职业的能力，相反，他们擅长一般的咒语或口头禅。咒语被大多数法师抛弃，仅仅是为了方便，不需要额外的技能训练，但流浪者采取了另一种方法。通过投入时间和精力去理解咒语，流浪者能够在效果，法力消耗和效率方面提高几乎所有的通用能力。\n有关详细信息，请参见技能。</TM_Cantrips.description>
